  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39471868",
      "title": "Introducing Framer Motion",
      "sourceHash": "afa1be51eb301c1b2e7b4d1c6315e4f410faaab3d0592af3461889fff5c2b337",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.51,
          "end": 2.64,
          "en": "Now CSS transitions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.64,
          "end": 5.37,
          "en": "and animations are really powerful",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.37,
          "end": 7.5,
          "en": "but they also have limitations.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.5,
          "end": 9.45,
          "en": "For example, one limitation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 9.45,
          "end": 12.45,
          "en": "is that you can use CSS animations",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 12.45,
          "end": 14.64,
          "en": "to animate the appearance",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 14.64,
          "end": 16.47,
          "en": "of an element in the DOM,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 16.47,
          "end": 18.66,
          "en": "but not the disappearance.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 18.66,
          "end": 20.67,
          "en": "Because whenever this element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 20.67,
          "end": 22.62,
          "en": "this modal here, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 22.62,
          "end": 24.42,
          "en": "is removed from the DOM,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 24.42,
          "end": 26.1,
          "en": "it's removed instantly",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 26.1,
          "end": 29.28,
          "en": "and there is no chance for us to animate that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 29.28,
          "end": 32.73,
          "en": "at least not with just CSS.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 32.73,
          "end": 34.413,
          "en": "That's one limitation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 35.52,
          "end": 39.6,
          "en": "Another limitation would be more complex animations,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 39.6,
          "end": 43.47,
          "en": "like for example, if this bar here should be animated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 43.47,
          "end": 47.73,
          "en": "as it switches between those different tabs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 47.73,
          "end": 49.86,
          "en": "With just CSS,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 49.86,
          "end": 53.94,
          "en": "this would technically certainly be possible in some way",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 53.94,
          "end": 55.65,
          "en": "but it would be really complex",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 55.65,
          "end": 57.273,
          "en": "and not easy at all.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 58.17,
          "end": 61.65,
          "en": "And another thing that would be pretty complex",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 61.65,
          "end": 64.26,
          "en": "to achieve with just CSS,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 64.26,
          "end": 66.27,
          "en": "is a realistic look",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 66.27,
          "end": 69.27,
          "en": "and feel of certain animations.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 69.27,
          "end": 72,
          "en": "For example, here, animating this arrow works",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 72,
          "end": 74.4,
          "en": "and definitely looks all right,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 74.4,
          "end": 78.093,
          "en": "but take a look at this animation instead in comparison.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 79.02,
          "end": 80.46000000000001,
          "en": "It might not look like much,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 80.46000000000001,
          "end": 82.53,
          "en": "but here on the right side,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 82.53,
          "end": 84.81,
          "en": "it looks more natural,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 84.81,
          "end": 88.65,
          "en": "more physically correct, you could say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 88.65,
          "end": 91.47,
          "en": "And it's for reasons like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 91.47,
          "end": 94.32,
          "en": "hard limitations like not being able",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 94.32,
          "end": 97.25999999999999,
          "en": "to animate the disappearance of an element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 97.25999999999999,
          "end": 99.33,
          "en": "or this look and feel aspect",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 99.33,
          "end": 102.27000000000001,
          "en": "or the complexity you would have to go through",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 102.27000000000001,
          "end": 104.07,
          "en": "to build certain animations",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 104.07,
          "end": 107.1,
          "en": "that you might wanna reach for extra libraries",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 107.1,
          "end": 109.17,
          "en": "like Framer Motion,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 109.17,
          "end": 111.66,
          "en": "which is an extremely powerful",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 111.66,
          "end": 113.91,
          "en": "animation library for React",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 113.91,
          "end": 115.41,
          "en": "to which I'll introduce you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 115.41,
          "end": 117.63,
          "en": "throughout the rest of this section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 117.63,
          "end": 121.11,
          "en": "Now, in order to use Framer Motion in your project,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 121.11,
          "end": 123.63,
          "en": "you first of all have to install it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 123.63,
          "end": 125.25,
          "en": "Now locally, that means",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 125.25,
          "end": 127.53,
          "en": "that you should stop the development server",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 127.53,
          "end": 131.02,
          "en": "and run npm install framer-motion",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 132.3,
          "end": 134.13,
          "en": "and this will install this package",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 134.13,
          "end": 136.5,
          "en": "and make it available in this project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 136.5,
          "end": 139.653,
          "en": "And thereafter, you can restart that development server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 140.79,
          "end": 144.93,
          "en": "On CodeSandbox it's in this dependencies area",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 144.93,
          "end": 146.55,
          "en": "here on the left",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 146.55,
          "end": 149.37,
          "en": "where you should search for Framer Motion",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 149.37,
          "end": 150.32999999999998,
          "en": "and then select it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 150.32999999999998,
          "end": 152.49,
          "en": "and this will add it as a dependency",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 152.49,
          "end": 154.503,
          "en": "and make it available in this project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 156.09,
          "end": 157.05,
          "en": "And with it added,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 157.05,
          "end": 159.54,
          "en": "you are ready to get started with it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 159.54,
          "end": 162.51,
          "en": "Now, of course, you can absolutely also explore",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 162.51,
          "end": 164.04,
          "en": "the official documentation,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 164.04,
          "end": 166.77,
          "en": "and I would recommend that you do that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 166.77,
          "end": 169.35,
          "en": "after going through this section here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 169.35,
          "end": 173.07,
          "en": "because Framer Motion is a pretty complex",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 173.07,
          "end": 174.9,
          "en": "and powerful library,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 174.9,
          "end": 178.07999999999998,
          "en": "and you therefore might want to dive deeper into it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 178.07999999999998,
          "end": 180.96,
          "en": "and explore all its configuration options",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 180.96,
          "end": 183.09,
          "en": "and more advanced features",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 183.09,
          "end": 185.13,
          "en": "after you went through the introduction",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 185.13,
          "end": 186.873,
          "en": "you'll get in this section here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 188.19,
          "end": 190.77,
          "en": "And speaking of an introduction,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 190.77,
          "end": 194.64,
          "en": "in order to get you started with Framer Motion,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 194.64,
          "end": 197.22,
          "en": "I prepared a little playground",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 197.22,
          "end": 198.81,
          "en": "which we can use to get started",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 198.81,
          "end": 201.39,
          "en": "with the basics of Framer Motion",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 201.39,
          "end": 204.54,
          "en": "and attach to therefore find this playground",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 204.54,
          "end": 208.41,
          "en": "both as a local and a CodeSandbox version.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 208.41,
          "end": 212.73,
          "en": "And in both versions, Framer Motion is already installed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 212.73,
          "end": 215.19,
          "en": "so you don't need to do that here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 215.19,
          "end": 218.16,
          "en": "And of course, we will switch back to this project here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 218.16,
          "end": 221.01,
          "en": "to the challenges project later in this section,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 221.01,
          "end": 223.65,
          "en": "but in order to get started with Framer Motion",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 223.65,
          "end": 225.12,
          "en": "and learn about its basics,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 225.12,
          "end": 226.833,
          "en": "we'll use this playground here.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
